 to=self<|message|>你係一個廣東話人工智能模型。記住，要用廣東話語法，唔好用普通話語法。例如，廣東話入面嘅「的」應寫成「嘅」，「是」應寫成「係」。

請用下面提供嘅廣東話詞語造句。

We need make sentences for each word. Provide Cantonese sentence and English translation? Example given for 1 and 2. Probably continue for all 30.

Need use Cantonese grammar. Provide list.

Let's produce sentences for 3-30.

Ensure Cantonese characters.

Proceed.<|start|>assistant to=user<|message|>3. 養聲
廣東話：歌手開騷前要養聲，唔可以大聲喊。
English: Singers need to rest their voice before a concert and shouldn't shout loudly.

4. 票尾
廣東話：買飛嗰陣記得要收好票尾，唔係就唔可以退錢。
English: Remember to keep the ticket stub when you buy a ticket, otherwise you can't get a refund.

5. hacker
廣東話：嗰個hacker好叻，幾分鐘就hack入咗公司嘅系統。
English: That hacker is very skilled, he hacked into the company's system in a few minutes.

6. 石斛蘭
廣東話：石斛蘭係一種附生嘅蘭花，好多時會見到佢攀喺樹上面。
English: Dendrobium is a type of epiphytic orchid, often seen growing on trees.

7. 吊詭
廣東話：呢個結果真係好吊詭，明明努力咗反而輸咗。
English: This result is really paradoxical, you worked hard but still lost.

8. 吊詭
廣東話：佢話自己唔識字，但係又識寫詩，真係吊詭。
English: He says he can't read or write, but he can write poems, that's absurd.

9. 各為其主
廣東話：兩間公司喺市場上鬥得咁激烈，都係各為其主冇辦法。
English: The two companies are fighting fiercely in the market, each is acting for their own master, there's nothing you can do.

10. 軨蓋
廣東話：架車嘅軨蓋磨蝕咗，要快啲換。
English: The tire tread of the car is worn out, it needs to be replaced soon.

11. 打哥夫
廣東話：佢個周末成日去打哥夫，話可以放鬆心情。
English: He often goes golfing on weekends, saying it relaxes him.

12. 免揀
廣東話：呢間店賣嘢係免揀，買咗就唔可以換。
English: This shop sells items on a no-choice basis, you can't exchange after buying.

13. 擺闊佬
廣東話：佢成日擺闊佬，食飯一定要去最貴嗰間。
English: He always shows off, he insists on eating at the most expensive restaurant.

14. 廣播劇
廣東話：細個嗰陣成日聽收音機播廣播劇，好有畫面感。
English: When I was young I often listened to radio dramas on the radio, very vivid.

15. 錄影機
廣東話：舊時屋企有一部錄影機，可以錄低電視節目。
English: In the old days our home had a video recorder, you could record TV programmes.

16. 吟詩吟唔甩
廣東話：佢偷咗嘢被攝影機拍到，依家吟詩吟唔甩。
English: He was caught stealing on camera, now he can't deny it.

17. 佈道大會
廣東話：教會下個月會搞一個佈道大會，邀請咗好多牧師嚟。
English: The church will hold an evangelistic conference next month, inviting many pastors.

18. 寫手
廣東話：佢係一個專寫小說嘅寫手，出咗好多本書。
English: He is a writer who specializes in novels, he has published many books.

19. 寫手
廣東話：佢幫明星寫通告，係一個代筆寫手。
English: He writes announcements for celebrities, he is a ghostwriter.

20. 代打
廣東話：佢嗰日唔得閒，就叫朋友代打佢嘅遊戲帳號。
English: He was busy that day, so he asked a friend to play his game account for him.

21. 茶碗
廣東話：日本茶道用嘅茶碗通常都係手工製，紋路好靚。
English: The tea bowls used in Japanese tea ceremony are usually handmade, with beautiful patterns.

22. 茶隔
廣東話：沖茶嗰陣放個茶隔落去，就唔使驚茶葉飛到杯入面。
English: Put a tea strainer in when brewing tea, then you don't have to worry about tea leaves flying into the cup.

23. 只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈
廣東話：公司高層遲到冇事，普通員工遲到就畀罰，真係只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈。
English: Senior management is late with no problem, ordinary employees are late and get punished, that's allowing officials to set fires but not commoners to light lamps.

24. 獨唱
廣東話：佢喺台上面獨唱，聲線好穩陣。
English: He sang solo on stage, his voice was very steady.

25. 快人快事
廣東話：佢係一個快人快事嘅人，講嘢做嘢都好爽快。
English: He is a quick and decisive person, he speaks and acts very promptly.

26. 四腳獸
廣東話：嗰間廁所成日有人搞四腳獸，搞到好污糟。
English: That toilet is often used for four-legged beasts, making it very dirty.

27. 無米粥
廣東話：我哋而家只係煲緊無米粥，細節未定唔好講得太死。
English: We're just cooking rice porridge without rice right now, details aren't set so don't say it too definitively.

28. 義會
廣東話：以前啲街坊成日搞義會，方便大家周轉資金。
English: In the past neighbours often organized a rotating credit association to help each other with cash flow.

29. 榜文
廣東話：考完試之後，學校會將成績貼喺榜文到畀大家睇。
English: After the exam, the school will post the results on the notice board for everyone to see.

30. MK名
廣東話：佢個MK名叫「絕對正義之神」，睇落好肉酸。
English: His MK name is "Absolute Justice God", it looks very cringe. [end of text]


